## 4. WILLOW PROTOCOL / EARTHSTAR — SPEC FINISHED, IMPLEMENTATIONS ARCHIVED

**Funding: NLnet, explicitly.** https://willowprotocol.org/more/about-us/ : *"funded through the NGI Assure Fund, a fund established by NLnet with financial support from the European Commission's Next Generation Internet programme… under grant agreement № 957073."* Aljoscha Meyer employed at TU Berlin while working on it. Two people: Aljoscha Meyer (Berlin) + Sam Gwilym (The Hague), working as **worm-blossom** since 2022. OpenCollective at `opencollective.com/worm-blossom`. Amounts **NOT REACHED** (`nlnet.nl/project/Willow/` → 404; project page slug not found).

**Spec activity (from willowprotocol.org RSS, fetched directly):**
- News: 2024-01-17 site launch · 2024-05-06 willow-js · 2024-05-23 Drop Format · 2024-05-29 · 2024-06-19 Confidential Sync promoted to "Candidate" · 2024-08-10 Rust Meadowcap · **2025-10-26 "A lot of everything"** — the last news item, **10+ months ago**.
- Changelog: only three entries ever — 2024-01-17, 2024-04-26, **2025-10-26**.

**Implementations — this is the decisive measurement:**
| Repo | Stars | Last push | State |
|---|---|---|---|
| earthstar-project/**willow-rs** (reference Rust impl) | 89 | 2025-10-23 | **ARCHIVED** |
| earthstar-project/willow-js | 83 | 2025-03-26 | dormant, last release 0.5.3 (2024-07-04) |
| earthstar-project/meadowcap-js | 32 | 2024-07-04 | dormant |
| earthstar-project/willow-utils | 10 | 2024-07-04 | dormant |
| **n0-computer/iroh-willow** | 74 | 2026-08-31 | **dependabot-only since 2025-11-17** — last human commit "chore: Remove unused import" |
| earthstar-project/**earthstar** | 920 | **2025-04-12** | last release **11.0.0-beta.2, 2024-05-21**; still beta; last human commit 2024-08-08 |

n0's 2024 roadmap promised *"new protocols like willow out into the world sooner."* That did not happen — iroh-willow has had no substantive commit in ~10 months and Willow is absent from iroh 1.0.

**Does anything ship on it?** Searching GitHub for Willow implementations returns only ports and stubs: `Deln0r/willow-go` (10 stars), `marukun712/willow-ts` (0), `willow-network/willow-sdk-rust` (0), `n0-computer/willow-store` (0, last push 2025-01-17). **No shipped end-user application on Willow was found.**

**Verdict: an excellent, complete, grant-funded specification with an archived reference implementation and zero shipped applications.** Earthstar itself has been in v11 beta for over two years.

