## 5. VEILID (cDc, DEF CON 31, Aug 2023) — ACTIVELY DEVELOPED, ESSENTIALLY ONE PERSON, NO ADOPTION

**Core repo (GitLab, gitlab.com/veilid/veilid):** created 2023-07-04, **449 stars, 189 forks, last activity 2026-09-04.** Tags: v0.5.0 (2025-12-21), 0.5.1, 0.5.2 (2026-01-28), 0.5.3 (2026-03-23), 0.5.4 (06-22), 0.5.5 (06-27), 0.5.6 (07-10), **v0.5.7 (2026-07-19)**. **Still pre-1.0 three years after launch.**

**Bus factor ≈ 1.** Of the last 10 commits (2026-08-18 → 2026-09-04), **9 are by Christien Rioux** (cDc "DilDog"): "census gate system and more aggressive preventative clippy rules", "veilid-flutter multi-attach fixes", "fix timestamp api and improve inspect fanout", "log and lock fixes", "locks" ×2, "setup fixes", "More bugfixes for mocks, performance, and tests". One outside commit (kimmy.zip, a Windows JDK version check).

**Did any app ship?** **VeilidChat exists and is maintained** — gitlab.com/veilid/veilidchat, **60 stars, last activity 2026-09-03**, tags v0.4.3 (2024-08-06) → v0.4.5 (2024-11-04) → v0.4.6/0.4.7 (2025-03/04) → v0.4.8 (2025-06-03) → **v0.4.9 (2025-08-07)**. Still 0.4.x. Third-party: `cmars/stigmerge` (86 stars, active 2026-09-04), `OpenArchive/save-dweb-backend` (26), `LGro/reunicorn` (26), `RangerMauve/veilid-iroh-blobs` (10 — note: a bridge *to iroh*), `jdbohrman-tech/alt-veilid` ("a fork of Veilid for people who care about DX", HN 2025-06-05).

**Attention collapsed after launch.** HN: 180 pts (2023-08-11 launch), 184 pts (2024-04-26 re-post), 30 pts (Register, 2023-08-12), EFF writeup 34 pts (2023-12-16). **After 2024-04: 4 points (2025-11-12), 2 points (2025-06-05).** Nothing since.

**Funding: NOT REACHED.** veilid.com discloses none; `veilid.com/about/` → 404. No foundation financials found.

**Verdict: technically alive, socially dead.** Three years, still 0.5.x, one committer, no app past 0.4.9.

